{"articleNo":"40269","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=40269&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"조기졸업 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.02.17","hit":"8312","attachments":[{"name":"조기졸업 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=40269&attachNo=1663"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 신청자격</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 입학후 4학기 이내에 조기졸업을 신청하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">나.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"> 직전학기까지 매학기 15학점이상 수강하여 성적 평점평균이 4.30이상인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"> 자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">다. 징계를 받지 아니한 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 신청기간 :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2012. 2. 22(수) ～ 2. 24(금) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">조기졸업신청서 및 성적증명서 1부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 제출장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">해당 종합학사행정실</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 조기졸업 요건</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">조기졸업을 신청한 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 6학기이상 등록하여 소정의 전과정을 이수한 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(건축학전공은 8학기이상 등록하여야 함)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 졸업요건을 모두 충족한 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 성적 평점평균이 4.30이상인 자 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2012.&nbsp; 2.&nbsp; 17.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
